# Analytical chamber equilibrium pressure - Vieille burn-rate balance
# Q2D_new test/2D/euler/SRM-rocket-motor -- piano section-5 Fase 8c criterion C2
# Formula: P_eq = [aCoeff * c_star * (A_chamber/A_throat) / pRef^n]^(1/(1-n))
# Inputs:
#   aCoeff   = 50.0 kg/(m^2*s) at pRef
#   n        = 0.3
#   pRef     = 1.0000e+06 Pa
#   Taf      = 3000.0 K
#   rhoG     = 1800.0 kg/m^3
#   SF_geo   = 1.0
#   R_gas    = 287.05 J/kg/K (air, M=28.97)
#   gamma    = 1.4
#   A_chamber= 1.266979e-02 m^2 (= pi*R_c^2 from MESH/profile.dat[0])
#   A_throat = 1.299394e-03 m^2 (= pi*R_t^2 from MESH/profile.dat[argmin])
#   Kn       = 9.7505
#   c_star   = 1355.2491 m/s
# P_eq_Pa
5.532003e+05
